[Adapter: Flux (Flux 2 Pro / Flux 1.1 Pro / Flux Dev) › Where parameters go] In the `flux.txt` output, document parameters as a comment line above each prompt:
# shot_01, params: ar=9:16, seed=2840193, upsampling=false
{prompt}

[Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Syntax pattern] {Paragraph 1: subject, action, spatial composition}

{Paragraph 2: environment and contextual details}

{Paragraph 3: lighting, photographic specs, mood}

[Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Parameters] Document in comment:
# shot_01, params: size=1024x1792, quality=high, style=natural, model=gpt-image-1.5
{prompt}

[Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Composition pattern] {Subject paragraph: who is in the frame, what they're doing, where they are positioned in the composition. Reference series_lock character anchor verbatim.}

{Environment paragraph: setting, props, contextual elements. Pull from series_lock environment.}

{Technical paragraph: lighting from series_lock, photographic spec, color grade from brand_lock, mood. Close with "natural skin texture, no AI rendering artifacts" if photoreal.}

[Adapter: Ideogram (v3) › Parameters] Document in comment block:
# shot_01, params: ar=9:16, model=V_3, magic_prompt=OFF, style=DESIGN, seed=2840193
{prompt}

[Adapter: Kling 3.0 (motion-aware video) › Parameters] Document parameters as a comment line above each prompt:
# shot_01. Kling 3.0: duration=5s, ar=9:16, cfg=0.5, start_image=frames/round-1/shot_01.png
{prompt}
